==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|backs into|backing into|backed into}}

# {{&lit|back|into|lang=en}}
# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To rely upon another [[team]]'s [[loss]] in order to [[advance]] to the [[post-season]], especially in the context of one's own team's loss.
#: ''The 2006 St. Louis Cardinals '''backed into''' the playoffs.''

